{
  "bookId": "hero-214013",
  "id": "bond-26057",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "26057001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "主人，为什么一直盯着我看……我的脸上有颜料吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26057002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "颜料倒是没有，只是觉得奇怪。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26057003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "从不知道什么时候开始，拉斐尔好像就一直在偷偷观察我？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26057004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "……！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26057005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "还是说，这只是我的错觉。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26057006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "……这不是主人的错觉，我确实有在观察主人。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26057007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "这是为了取材。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26057008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "取材？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26057009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "因为……从来没有画过主人。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26057010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "所以偷偷观察，是觉得不是好意思吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26057011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "不，不是……这是为了给主人一个惊喜。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26057012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "但现在……应该不算惊喜了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26057013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "不，当然算。我还没看到拉斐尔会画出怎样的我。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26057014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "拉斐尔要送我礼物的话，那我得好好配合才行。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26057015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "主，主人……你这是要做什么？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
